window.products.push({"id":732036,"name":"Poly and Bark Vortex Arm Chair Walnut Leg, Teal, Set of 2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uWNYm8IQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The brightly colored DAW Chair (Dining height Armchair Wooden base), first designed in 1948, is one of the most recognizable pieces from E.'s furniture collection. It boasts a beautifully flowing shell seat, which is molded to fit the lines of the body. The rolled edge prevents the seat from pressing into the back of the legs. This triumph of design was created for the \"Low Cost Furniture Design\" Competition at the New York Museum of Modern Art and went on to become the first mass-produced plastic chair. The innovative methods of molding and bending, developed by the popular designer, established the DAW Chair series as a true furniture icon of the 20th century. Poly+Bark produces the shell of this design classic in a quality and durable polypropylene plastic, available in several bright colors. It is supported by wooden legs interconnected by wires, adding an intricate touch to contrast with the chair's simple, organic design. Overall Product Dimensions:23.6\"L x 24.6\"W x 31.5\"H Seat Dimensions: 17.5\" D x 18\" W x 18.1\" H Arm Height: 26.3\".","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uWNYm8IQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"POLY & BARK","source_asin":"B00R464QR6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-732036","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00R464QR6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00R464QR6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
