window.products.push({"id":732278,"name":"MIFXIN Sectional Sofa Covers L Shape Sectional Couch Slipcover 2 Pcs Stretch L-Type Chaise Corner Sofa Furniture Protector Slip Cover for Pets Kids Do","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MSMZQSZRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MIFXIN Sectional L Sofa Cover is 2 pieces separate regular sofa covers. Both of them are regular sofa cover design and in the same size. One for the chaise and the other for main sofa. Only suitable for L-shaped sectional sofas combined by 2 parts separately. NOT suitable for a whole L-shaped sofa that can not be separated. Pls make sure your sofa has deep gap to insert the foam strips. For sofa with a shallow gap or without gap, our slipcover may not have a good effect. Size for L Shape Sofa: Sofa length (A-A part) between 74 to 90 Inch (185cm-230cm) & sofa length (B-B part) between 74 to 90 Inch (185cm-230cm) Pillow Cover Size: 45*45cm / 17.72*17.72inch How to install? Step 1: Position the slipcover over the sofa with the label at the back. Step 2: Pull the fabric evenly over the sofa, and push white sponge cylinders in spaces between the cushions, shaping the cover to the sofa and keeping fabric tight. Step 3: Tilt the sofa up and find elastic ties. Pull the front and back ties together tightly and tie. Pull the side ties together and tightly Step 4: Put the sofa down and cover tight, pulling any excess fabric to the back. Step 5: Enjoy your newly covered sofa! Attention -Do not use bleach and wash it with same/similar colors. -Manual measurement 1-4cm error is allowable. -The digital images we display have the most accurate color possible.Please allow a littler color difference. Package Included 2 * Sofa Slipcovers 2 * Pillow Covers Some foam sticks","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MSMZQSZRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MIFXIN","source_asin":"B098D886M8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-732278","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B098D886M8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B098D886M8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":732279,"name":"Starbucks Double Wall Traveler DOT Collection - Siren in Water, 12 Fl Oz","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41kFnFqd-KL._AC_.jpg","description":"Discover the gold-adorned Siren that lives beneath the sea—and graces this collectible coffee mug. The split-tailed Siren's cherubic face forms the \"dot\" in this Dot Collection design. Metallic embellishments in the art are echoed in the mug's gold rim and lid. The mug's function is just as beautiful as its form: double wall construction helps keep coffee hot while hands stay cool, and its press-in lid with silicone seal helps prevent spills. Grippy rubber pad on bottom. Holds 12 fl oz. Handwash only. Do not microwave. Part of our Dot Collection, the mug comes ready-to-gift in a bright red box with a dot of holiday shine.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41kFnFqd-KL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Starbucks","source_asin":"B00PIP06I8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-732279","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00PIP06I8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00PIP06I8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
