window.products.push({"id":732285,"name":"Shower Caddy Over Shower Head, YASONIC Stable Hanging Shower Caddy with Soap Holder, Rustproof Stainless Steel Hanging Shower Organizer for Bathroom, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SVP1nMJ7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🧴【All-in-One Shower Caddy】- The hanging shower caddy comes with 3 storage baskets and 10 hooks satisfies all your family toiletry storage needs. The 3-tier shower shelf for shampoos, conditioners, body wash, bar soap, 10 hooks for razors, sponge, towels, etc. It will maximize your bathroom shower stalls with the shower caddy over shower head. 🚿【Stable Hanging】- This hanging shower organizer perfectly fits most shower heads, the hook of the shower caddy is equipped with a non-slip grippy rubber collar to keep the bathroom shower organizer stable, strong adhesives with zip ties fix the caddy to the shower wall to ensure no swing when you fetch items, , the maximum load can be up to 40lbs. 🛁【Rustproof & Fast Draining】- The stainless steel shower caddy over shower head adds rustproof coating to the surface for secondary protection, which improves the corrosion resistance and scratch resistance. The hollow design of the shower rack allows quick drainage to keep your bath products dry and clean. 🚿【Easy to Install】- Simply assemble the shower caddy hanging with screws, hang it over the shower head caddy, fix the bathroom caddy to the wall with the collar and adhesives with zip ties. Our hanging shower caddy provides detailed installation instructions, you can also watch the video for assembly, install the caddy organizer without drilling holes. 📧【Stylish Bathroom Shower Organizer】- The modern style black shower caddy is suitable for home, apartments, college dorm rooms, it can be hung not only on the shower, but also on the hook. If you have any problems please feel free to contact us. YASONIC will provide a 30-day money-back guarantee for any reason and a 12-month warranty for quality-related issues. 📏【Size】- The top shelf: 12.6\" x 4.33\" x 3.35\"(L×W×H) . The middle shelf: 11.8\" x 3.94\" x 2.5\"(L×W×H). The soap sheft: 5.5\" x 3.54\" x 1.58\"(L×W×H)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SVP1nMJ7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YASONIC","source_asin":"B0BFDNTSBZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-732285","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BFDNTSBZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BFDNTSBZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
