window.products.push({"id":732319,"name":"Yoshihiro High Speed Steel Gyuto Chefs Knife Black Pakkawood Handle (8.25\"/210mm & Saya)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":274.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61r7PrjNLKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Knife Features → Blade Material: High Speed Stain Resistant Stainless Steel (SRS13) →Edge Angle: Double Edged  →Grade: High Speed  →Handle Shape: Western  →Handle Material: Black Pakkawood →HRC:63-64 →Knife Style: Gyuto Chef Knife  →Stain Resistant: Yes  →Saya Cover: Optional Lacquered Saya Cover  Our Yoshihiro High Speed Steel series beautifully brings together incredible sharpness, long lasting edge retention, stain resistance, and an ease of sharpening that outclasses many other knives currently on the market. The outstanding performance of the knife is the result of combining state-of-the-art metallurgy with the bountiful knowledge and skill of the master craftsmen.The most versatile and essential of all knives a cook can have is a Japanese chefs knife known as a Gyuto knife. The Gyuto is a Japanese chefs knife with a curved blade that smoothly rocks back and forth and has an extended tip for quick chopping that can be used to cut meat, fish, and vegetables. Proudly made in Japan and not mass produced.  This knife is complimented with a premium Western Style Handle that extends to the full tang of the knife and ergonomically welds to the hand for seamless use. An optional and recommended protective wooden sheath called a Saya can be purchased together, which protects the knife and adds to its appearance when not in use. Every knife from Yoshihiro is handcrafted by master artisans creating a unique one-of-a-kind work of art.Traditional Japanese knife making values a sharp edge, which requires attention and care. Sharpening and honing should be done with only water whetstones. Hand wash and dry only, and do so immediately if working with acidic ingredients. Do not use on objects such as bones, nutshells, and frozen foods.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61r7PrjNLKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yoshihiro","source_asin":"B0176XANDM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-732319","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0176XANDM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0176XANDM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":732320,"name":"uxcell Body Pillow Cover 20x48 Inch Brown Silky Satin Body Pillowcases for Hair and Skin Luxury Cooling Anti Wrinkle Wash-","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.09,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/4163RSCTPJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A SECRET FOR SWEET DREAMS : Satin body pillowcases uses high quality charmeuse, more elasticity than sateen and silk pillow cases, with inimitable feel and glossy appearance.The combination of sophisticated design and durability and softness allows you to sleep comfortably every night for years to come! Sleep on it, you will sleep well overnight and enjoy sweet dreams. Cool during the summer and warm in the winter, a satin pillowcase is a luxury to be enjoyed throughout the year. A MYSTERIOUS FOR BEST MORNING : Satin materials never absorbs facial moisture, it helps your skin maintain its natural moisture and move without friction, makes you wake up without fine lines on your face from your pillow. With this satin pillow case, skin is able to breathe more which helps with minimizing pores, reducing irritation and redness, and increasing firmness. This satin body pillow cover is the most natural anti sleep-creases and anti bed-head product. A MAGIC FOR SALON HAIR: Our Satin body pillow cases also keep your hair safe from harm, avoiding matting, knotting, breakage, snagging and reduce hair loss. It helps to retain your shiny hairstyle and frizz free, perfect for curl and natural hair. This satin body pillow cover helps keep fragile eyelashes intact, can be especially helpful for those who wear eyelash extensions. A STYLISH FOR ENVELOPE CLOSURE : The internal stitching has an open pocket to form an envelope shell. We avoid adding any uncomfortable buttons on our body pillow cases. Wash satin pillowcases in Cold Water on a Gentle or Delicate Cycle. Avoid stuffing the pillowcases with the things which containing harsh or heavy fabrics such as denim jeans, as these may snag the satin. Either Tumble Dry on Low Heat, or draped over a clothesline, air dry. 100% SATISFACTION : We you'll love this satin body pillow cases, and if you aren't absolutely satisfied. Please simply contact us to return the product for a full refund. Note: This is case only, does NOT contain a body pillow. Due to the light and screen setting difference, the color of the item may be slightly different from the pictures.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/4163RSCTPJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"uxcell","source_asin":"B07WF5DVG1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-732320","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WF5DVG1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WF5DVG1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
