window.products.push({"id":732490,"name":"Digital Meat Thermometer for Grilling BBQ Cooking Steaks Barbecue Long Probe and Ready Alarm (Orange)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FiGhtG7jL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"TIRED OF MESSING UP YOUR BARBEQUE? When it comes to grilling meat, trying to get it just right is not always easy. You know from experience that using sight and touch to determine the readiness of your meat is never enough. You often end up with a batch that pleases some people but gets complaints from others. Wouldn’t it be nice if you could have a tool that will help you become more consistent with your grilling results? ELIMINATES THE GUESSWORK It’s hard to tell if a piece of meat is ready just by looking at it. Our meat thermometer takes away the guesswork, ensuring you get it perfect every time. It comes with a flashing doneness indicator that lets you know when your steak is ready. THE DIGITAL ADVANTAGE Our digital thermometer takes ease of use to the next level. It provides meat choices and taste settings. Simply choose the setting you prefer and wait for the sound of an alarm to tell you your grilled food is good to go. This meat thermometer also comes with a large lighted screen, making it easy to see the temperature even when it’s dark. AVOID OVERCOOKING Our digital thermometer helps ensure you’re sticking with the right temperature, allowing the meat to stay juicy and tender. To ensure accurate reading, make sure you are sticking the thermometer into the thickest part of the meat. ENJOY DELICIOUS STEAKS With our meat thermometer, you no longer have to go to fancy restaurants to enjoy a delicious steak. You can consistently have your own delicious cuts at home! Our meat thermometer comes with a bonus eBook that will help you master the art of barbecuing. NEVER WASTE GOOD MEAT AGAIN One important advantage of using our digital thermometer is that you’ll never end up with wasted meat again. Messing up your barbecue after you’ve put in all the work can be a real bummer. It’s a waste of effort, time and money as well.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FiGhtG7jL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Grille Perfect","source_asin":"B084KQ8N2Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-732490","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B084KQ8N2Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B084KQ8N2Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":732491,"name":"Espresso Machine Head Gasket Group Brew Seal For Cuisinart EM-100 EM100 EM-200 EM200 Espresso Machines","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/11mO2iT7ZsL._AC_.jpg","description":"Available for sale is a brand new replacement Brew Head Seal for the Cuisinart EM-100 and EM-200 Espresso Machines. These are extremely hard to find, but are simple to replace. This is a BRAND NEW item still sealed in the original plastic packaging.  These seals secure your portafilter to the brew head when making espresso. Heat and pressure causes the silicone wear out over time which leads to your machine leaking water. Since these machines are 15-Bar units, the higher pressure causes the seals to leak when the seals age and they need to be replaced every 4-6 months depending on how much your machine is used. For Cuisinart models : EM-100 and EM-200","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/11mO2iT7ZsL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Velodi","source_asin":"B07N8XM25X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-732491","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07N8XM25X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07N8XM25X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
