window.products.push({"id":732515,"name":"Glad White Extra Large Cutting Chopping Board | Dishwasher Safe | Non Porous, Easy to Clean, Gentle on Knives, 16.25 x 10.25","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.96,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41N2gpA0U3L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This White Cutting Board by Glad will make meal prep, cooking dinner, and chopping fruits and vegetables a piece of cake.Ask a professional chef, and they will tell you that one factor to making superb meals is having the right tools. Whether you are a trained chef working in a fast-paced kitchen or at home cooking for the entire family, you need a tough arsenal of kitchen gadgets that stay beautifully for a long period of time. Let this Cutting Board from Glad be your partner in providing a smooth and pleasant kitchen experience for you and your family.If you’re looking for a dependable chopping board, look no further. Glad’s plastic cutting board for kitchen is best suited for your cooking needs. Our plastic cutting board is made of strong, high-quality plastics. This choice of material gives our cutting board the resilience and the gentleness to survive repeated contact with knives. Thus, it can withstand the sharpest or the heaviest of knives, without causing dullness, cracks, or warping.Product Details:• Formulated with CLOROX to resist stains and odors• DISHWASHER SAFE for hassle-free cleanup so you can spend less time in the kitchen and more time with your family• Made of NON-POROUS POLYPROPYLENE so it won’t absorb oil and any food material• GENTLE ON KNIVES and won’t bend, warp, splinter, crack or peel• LIGHTWEIGHT AND DURABLE this cutting board is a handy tool to keep around the kitchen and will last for a long time• Constructed with a BUILT-IN HANDLE HOLE at one end for easy handling and so you can hang this cutting board when not in useThis Glad Cutting Board will surely be a valuable addition to your kitchen. Add this item to your cart today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41N2gpA0U3L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Glad","source_asin":"B07W8RXWRN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-732515","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07W8RXWRN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07W8RXWRN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
