window.products.push({"id":732592,"name":"Prepworks from Progressive Progressive ProKeeper Airtight Butter Container with Measure Markings, Turquoise 2.94 x 6.5 x 3 inches gbd-2 GBD-2TURQUOISE","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uv519OSLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Keep your butter safe with the Prepworks by Progressive Butter Keeper. It has a clear lid with a silicone seal on the base that creates an air-tight seal that will keep butter fresh longer. It also features measurement markings for both short and long sticks of butter up to 8 Tablespoons. It can be used both in and out of the fridge and is BPA-Free and Dishwasher safe. For over 40 years, our mission has been to create innovative kitchen tools and gadgets that make food preparation fun and fast while inspiring culinary creativity. From our thin store collapsibles to our sophisticated PL8 line, our dedication to providing quality products supported by superior customer service continues to drive our creative development today. At Progressive International, we continually strive to understand the needs of today's cooks. Our team includes talented, energetic and passionate people committed to reimagining the kitchen. We strive to pass our passion on to our consumers through our thoughtfully designed tools, layered with our avid desire to go beyond the expected. Our philosophy is simple: offer stylish designs complimented by no-nonsense functionality. We understand the kitchen is the heart of the home, where families and friends connect. Our ongoing mission is to provide exceptional kitchen essentials that help cooks of all skill levels create meals worth sharing. Prep Solutions, Prepworks and PL8 continues to build on the Progressive legacy by offering products that make food prep faster, easier and more enjoyable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uv519OSLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Progressive International","source_asin":"B09ZKCXZB5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-732592","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZKCXZB5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZKCXZB5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":732593,"name":"Xena Cast Throw Blanket","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zTtLn+T4L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"GIANT 70x54\" (178cm x 137cm) Xena Throw Blanket. They are 100% Cotton and Prewashed. Each Throw is woven from colored yarn, so the image is actually woven with individual colors and not printed. They are color fast and should be washed in cold water. They are created from about 8 miles of yarn and weigh about 3 lbs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zTtLn+T4L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Xena","source_asin":"B00W2TFLR4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-732593","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00W2TFLR4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00W2TFLR4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":732594,"name":"Xiamen Stainless Steel 12 cup Moka Pot Espresso Maker, Stove-top Coffee maker, Cuban Cafetera, Percolator, Brewer, Coffee Maker","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31gULLm6nuL._AC_.jpg","description":"A Moka Pot is a brewing device that uses steam pressure and an external heat source to create a strong coffee concentrate (usually about a 1:7 coffee to water ratio). Makes great tasting espresso quick & easy at a much more affordable price. Sleek and elegant, when handled and taken care of well. Easy assembly and disassembly for quick cleanup. Unit makes 12 espresso cups of coffee in just minutes (each cup is about 2 fluid ounces of liquid stovetop espresso). Durable Lightweight Stainless Steel body with pressure valve safety valve. Perfect to make Italian Espresso and Cuban Coffee. Extremely simple to use: 1-Fill with water to right below steam-valve on the base (preferable hot water to reduce the amount of time the moka pot has to sit on the stove and prevent your coffee from scorching) 2-Fill funnel with ground Italian or Cuban coffee (not too tight, don't overfill nor tamp so it won't clog) 3-Place Moka Pot on burner (low to medium heat on the edge of the burner instead of directly in the middle to help prevent your coffee from scorching and the handle from getting too hot). 4-Remove when you hear it starts to gurgle. Easy assembly and disassembly for quick cleanup: Let the Moka Pot cool before cleaning (it will stay hot for awhile). Unscrew the boiler, remove the filter basket and discard the grounds. As tempting as it may be, don’t bang the filter basket on the side of the garbage. If you do this, it will eventually dent and need to be replaced. Rinse all parts with cold water and hand dry. Needs to be well seasoned. No soap or abrasive surfaces (rinse only with hot water, leave the coffee oils on the metal surface to seal the pot) wipe with a rag. If steam leaks from the release valve, you’ve got a little too much pressure and need to remove the pot from heat. Try one of these:Make sure you didn’t overfill with grounds Make sure you didn’t tamp the grounds If you can check off the two above, use a lower heat. Your grounds could also be too fine","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31gULLm6nuL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Xiamen","source_asin":"B08HGKDSLJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-732594","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08HGKDSLJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08HGKDSLJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
