window.products.push({"id":732606,"name":"Ice Hockey Personalized Christmas Ornament - Female Player - Brown Hair - Handpainted Resin - 4.5\" Tall - Free Customization","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ulQv7jkVL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Start a tradition in your family of giving a personalized and dated Christmas ornament each year that represents an occasion, a milestone, a celebration, or a vacation! This ornament is made from cast resin. The material is similar to clay, but is lighter in weight. The ornament is carefully hand painted in permanent bright colors. The finish is a matte finish. The ornament comes with a ribbon loop for easy hanging on the Christmas tree. Each item is designed to be personalized to your order in our studio in Santa Rosa, California. All personalization is done by hand by artists. While lettering style will vary from artist to artist, all lettering is done to our high standards of beauty and legibility, using permanent black ink. Always double check the spelling of each name as once the ornament is personalized we can’t change it! We know you’ll enjoy giving this hand painted and carefully personalized and dated Christmas ornament. It will be enjoyed for years to come.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ulQv7jkVL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Calliope Designs","source_asin":"B01MRGTI27","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-732606","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MRGTI27","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MRGTI27","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":732607,"name":"Nuah Prints Bathroom Wall Decor Prints, Set of 4 Toilet Quotes and Sayings Art Prints, Bath Decor Printed Photos, 8x10 inches (Set #2)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kFi0gsjVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Add a Touch of Fun & Style To Your Everyday Bathroom Experience With Nuah Prints Bathroom Wall Decor Prints! Whether you want to remind your guests to wash their hands or just remember to put the lid down, Nuah Prints bathroom wall decor prints have you covered. We combine fun quotes with modern designs to ensure they fit right in with the décor of your bath! Our wash your hand art prints for the bathroom is polite, fun, and colorful making them the perfect choice for anyone that wants to brighten up the look of their toilet and put a smile on anyone’s face and uplift their mood while helping promote cleanliness. Versatile, Thick & Unframed Bathroom Wall Prints Set Nuah Prints fun bathroom sign art prints are made using thick paper that can stand up to daily use even in the long run. We use bright and eye-catching colors to make they are easy to notice while adding a colorful touch to the look of your bathroom. Looking for a birthday or Christmas gift for friends and family that is just as fun as it is unique? Our funny bathroom signs make the perfect gift for Christmas, Birthdays, Hanukkah, Brother or Sister, Wife, Husband, Co-workers, and anyone else on any occasion. More Features You’ll Love: - Dust resistant and durable for long term use - Complement the look of any modern bathroom - Come unframed so you can frame them the way you like - We use clean yet fun and uplifting designs - Each pack comes with 4 unique art prints for bathrooms Package Includes: 1 x Always Wash Your Hands Art Print 1 x Floss And Brush Your Teeth Art Print 1 x Flush The Toilet Close The Lid Art Print 1 x Wipe Your Butt Art Print Brighten Up The Look Of Your Bathroom With Nuah Prints Set Of 4 Bathroom Wall Decor Prints!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kFi0gsjVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nuah Prints","source_asin":"B08NRGVDQG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-732607","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08NRGVDQG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08NRGVDQG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":732608,"name":"Sweese 128.602 Salad Pasta Bowls 30oz, Porcelain Large Serving Bowls, Set of 6, Turquoise, Microwave Dishwasher Safe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61naqLnrxPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"THE FUNCTION IS MORE THAN PASTA - 30 Ounce capacity is suitable for pasta, dessert, ice cream, rice, beans and so on. Sweese shallow bowls could replace a dinner plate, especially good when eating a salad as you rarely end up with part of your salad on the table! GOOD SHAPE FOR PEOPLE AND PETS - The bowls are wide and shallow (8.3*1.8 inch), so the food doesn't get stuck, easy to spoon out everything with this shape. And the shape is also great for pets as they are relatively shallow and easy for your cats/dogs to get their faces into. MINIMALIST & CLASSIC STYLE - The minimalist round design makes the pasta bowls appeal to the eye. These white pasta bowls with brown rim look stylish and fantastic on the table. STACKABLE & EASY TO CLEAN - These pasta bowls are stackable and DON'T take up a lot of space in your cupboard. Easy to clean, you can wash them with soap and hot water or place them into your dishwasher. PRO-GRADE PORCELAIN & SAFE FOR DISHWASHER, MICROWAVE, OVEN AND FREEZER - These Sweese bowls are made of durable porcelain, a type of premium LEAD-FREE ceramic, chip-resistant and more sturdy than stoneware.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61naqLnrxPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sweese","source_asin":"B093TDZH7V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-732608","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093TDZH7V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093TDZH7V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
