window.products.push({"id":732779,"name":"Pocket Multifunctional Knife Sharper with Carbides Blades,Ceramic stones,Diamond-Tapered","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51pWAOIDR+L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Are you still using the hard way to sharpen your knives?Try this easy way now!Pocket Multifunctional Knife Sharper with Carbides Blades,Ceramic stones,Diamond-Tapered can sharpen your knives in seconds. Features: -- The Pocket Sharper features a fold out, tapered round diamond-coated rod for sharpening serrated and standard edges -- pre-set carbide blades for quickly restoring a dull edge, and specially shaped ceramic stones for a razor-sharp finish. The carbide blades and ceramic stones are reversible and replaceable for extended sharpening life. -- The Pocket Pal measures just 3-1/2 inches long and 1 inch wide, and it weighs just 1 ounce.  -- An integrated lanyard hole makes for easy carrying.  -- Always clean your sharpener with a damp cloth after use and towel dry. Do not rinse with water. Tips: Carbide Blades: Set the Edge,The carbide blades provide quick edge setting capability for dull or damaged knives. These blades are designed for use on straight edges only, and are reversible and replaceable. Ceramic Stones: Finish the Edge,Ceramic stones provide a smooth, polished edge for already sharp knives and can be used on serrated or standard blades. They're also reversible and replaceable. Package Including: 1 x knife sharpener Warranty & Customer Service About Naeny  We are a professional supplier,specialized in this field over 10 years . We care what you need and how comfortable you feel ,Choose Naeny . Choose quality. We offer a 100% money back & infinity replacement guarantee if you have problems with our knife sharpener.  We take care of every customer's issue, please do not hesitate to contact us if you have questions , we will respond within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51pWAOIDR+L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NAENY","source_asin":"B0765TW147","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-732779","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0765TW147","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0765TW147","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
