window.products.push({"id":732835,"name":"Savino | Glass Wine Saving Carafe Bundle | Frost & Seaglass | 750ml | Keep Non-Sparkling Wines Fresh Up To 7 Days | Luxury Glass Wine Preserver | Dish","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":94.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51SNKWGyKnL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"ENJOY MORE WINE – Enjoy a glass of wine without the fear of wasting the rest of your bottle and start using the Savino Connoisseur Wine Preserver that keeps wine fresh up to 7 days! Savino creates a new environment designed to preserve and serve wine with ease. Our glass decanter creates a barrier between the wine and the air to keep red and white non-sparkling wines fresh glass after glass. ELEGANT & EASY TO USE – Our stylish wine preservers hold up to 750ml and their slim design are the perfect height to easily fit in the refrigerator. Simply pour your wine into our chic glass or plastic decanter, insert the air stopper, and replace the lid to save your wine up to 7 days. There’s no need for the hassle of pumps or sprays to save your wine when using the effortless and efficient Savino Wine Preserver. THE PERFECT GIFT – Give the gift to wine just a little with the Savino wine preserver. The Savino Connoisseur Wine Carafe is sure to be a thoughtful, unique gift for the wine lovers in your life. Look no further for the perfect gift for Christmas, Birthdays, Mother’s & Father’s Day, or as a Congratulations for a special occasion. With six beautiful colors to choose from & our bundle options, you will find the perfect decanter for yourself and your wine drinking buddy! DURABLE & DISHWASHER SAFE – The beautiful glass & plastic wine savers are dishwasher safe for a hassle free clean after each use. Savino Connoisseur is made with high-quality, durable glass and the Savino Enthusiast is made with high-quality, durable, BPA free plastic and both have a sleek and elegant design for easy use and pour. Each preserver comes with its own stylish and compact tube container to always keep it accessible and safe. BY WINOS FOR WINOS – Fifteen years ago Scott, the CEO of Savino, started a mission to find the best wine preservation system for his wife. After years of disappointment with products that were available, it led Scott to develop an innovative solution, Savino. Made in the USA with the highest quality materials, Savino centers its experience on a product that is effective, elegant, and easy to use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51SNKWGyKnL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Savino","source_asin":"B09ZWCG9JQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-732835","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZWCG9JQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZWCG9JQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
