window.products.push({"id":732878,"name":"Zyliss Transparent Cheese Grater","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31SC4KG6XAL._AC_.jpg","description":"Amazon.com This classic tool grates hard cheeses, nuts, and chocolate with the turn of its crank. It's useful both in the kitchen and at the table--when hot pasta or chilled salad calls for a cascade of freshly grated cheese. Because the crank fits into either side (the other side remains open to spill out grated food), the grater works equally well for left-handers and right-handers. It's made of rugged transparent plastic, and the drum is stainless steel. It slips out of the grater for hand washing. The grater's well measures 1-1/4 by 2-1/4 inches; overall, it is 6 inches long. --Fred Brack","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31SC4KG6XAL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zyliss","source_asin":"B00005Q5FB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-732878","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00005Q5FB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00005Q5FB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":732879,"name":"PU Leather Square Tissue Box Cover - Multi-Functional Tissue Box Holder, Tissue Box Cover with Storage,Tissue and Remote Control Holder, Cube Tissue B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uAl39rnKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Tissue Box with Remote Control Holder】 it's a tissue box cover with storage nooks.compatible with most brand tissue boxes. can hold all size remote controls and mobile phones.With such an inspired design,provide more convenience for life. This tissue box holder is cute and stylish and also has extra compartments to hold remotes, glasses, and phone. These keep all table“stuff” organized in one place.you will find it useful to have in your office or by your bedside. 【Easy to Store & Refill New Tissues】Tissue Box Cover Size-5x5.8x5.7 inches.（L*W*H）Fully compatible with 99% square tissue boxes. easily holds most brand tissue boxes. Also Fits large square tissue boxes. More convenient Refill New Tissues method It only takes seconds to replace the tissue box. open it from the top, place the total tissue box, then close the tissue cover. The tissue lid has a magnetic top, The top cover can be magnetically held firmly. 【Multi-Functional Tissue Box Cover with storage】The tissue box cover and the 2 compartment are integrated into one. We are refer to the dimensions of remote control holder and phone size. Specially customized 2 large storage compartments. great for all remote controls ,mobile phone, glasses, or pencils/pens...enough to hold everything you need by your bedside table/ nightstand/ coffee table/end table/office desk. Everything is organized in one spot. 【Fits Your Decor Perfectly】Are you looking for a way to conceal those plain tissue boxes ? BLIENCE Tissue Box Cover :Made of high-quality materials: PU leather + MDF. sturdy and durable.The PU leather and stitching is a nice touch. The PU leather cover has exquisite embossed patterns and it turns an ordinary box of tissues into a object of art. Blends well with decor. Hide those dull tissue box and add a touch of style throughout your home and office. 【PERFECT AS GIFTS】 The decorative tissue box cover will be a perfect gift for you to share with your families and friends, it will match your home decor perfectly, add beauty and color to your home. And it's really an Ideal Gift for House warming, Wedding, Anniversary, Christmas, New Year!!!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uAl39rnKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BLIENCE","source_asin":"B0BP6WDCWG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-732879","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BP6WDCWG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BP6WDCWG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":732880,"name":"Department 56 Peanuts Village Snoopy's Cookie Jar Lit House, 6.77 inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71i8P-bn9ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"One Christmas Evening, a group of friends set off to enjoy a dinner of celebration at a small country Inn nestled in a quiet River town. As they rounded a bend in the road, they saw the small, old-fashioned village decorated for the holidays. The lights, like fairies, glowed and sparkled amid the freshly fallen snow. All Evening, the conversation was full of Christmas memories and the visions the tiny town had evoked. Amidst the jovial banter and magical memories, the idea for a lighted Christmas village was born. That spark of an idea became a reality when, in 1976, Department 56 introduced a series of six hand-painted, ceramic buildings. The rest is history. Department 56 knows the importance of celebrating the holidays with family and friends. Savor your time together and make it extra special with Department 56.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71i8P-bn9ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Department 56","source_asin":"B01A9A5C9O","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-732880","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01A9A5C9O","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01A9A5C9O","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":732881,"name":"ecozoi Leak Proof Stainless Steel Lunch Box, 3-in-1 Eco Bento Box | Redesigned Silicone Seal + Bonus Lunch Pod | Sustainable Tiffin Eco Friendly Metal","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MpScERILL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ECO-FRIENDLY & BPA FREE: This product is designed as an eco-friendly alternative to Plastic Bento lunch boxes. The materials used include high quality food grade 201 Stainless Steel that is PVC Free, Phthalate Free, Leaching Free, and Lower Carbon Footprint than Plastic. Comes in recycled packaging that can be completely reused (Zero Waste packaging). DIMENSIONS: All together when boxed up, the bento measures 5 inches wide, 6 1/2 inches long and 3 inches high and fits about 7 to 8 cups of food or 60 oz capacity. Each section is 1 3/4 inch deep. The mini pod inside is 1 1/2 inches deep and 4 1/2 inches long REDESIGNED SILICONE SEAL & BONUS LUNCH POD: The product comes with a bonus lunch pod for easy storage for nuts or fruit chunks for lunch. The redesigned silicone seal would help with the industry best leak proof performance and longevity of the product. This item is not intended to use by children 12 and under. LEAK PROOF & DISHWASHER SAFE: The top portion is leak proof. Bottom portion is not leak proof. Dishwasher Safe Metal Tupperware. However, for the lid we advise to wash with soap under cold water. Alternatively, if you place the lid in the dishwasher, the silicone seal may come off due to expansion caused by the hot water, in which case please wait for 2 mins for it to cool down before placing the seal back. LIFETIME WARRANTY: This product is designed to last forever! We guarantee 100% satisfaction and life time manufacturer warranty. If anything happens, just contact us for a free replacement.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MpScERILL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ecozoi","source_asin":"B08W6NQLWQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-732881","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08W6NQLWQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08W6NQLWQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
