window.products.push({"id":732913,"name":"Saxophone Ornament 2022 - Polyresin Saxophone Girl Ornament - Unique Music Themed Christmas Ornaments - Instrument Ornaments - Saxophone Gifts for Gir","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.94,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JDSlVF1DL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Premium Quality Polyresin Music Ornament – Unlike other Holiday décor that breaks and falls apart in a matter of weeks. Our Saxophone Christmas ornament 2022 is durable and lightweight for lasting quality and easy hanging on the family tree for a special twinkle in your ornament tree décor! Vibrant colors and festive details of a girl saxophone ornament. Add some holiday cheer to your home and bring the magic of music to your holiday tree with this adorable 2022 musical ornament! Expert Artist Personalization – unlike other personalized music Christmas ornaments that often arrive with messy, clumsy personalization (or worse, the wrong name). Our talented in-house artists handwrite each personalization to your exact specifications using custom paint pens imported from Germany. All our music ornaments 2022 are delicately hand painted to ensure a unique appearance for a ONE-OF-A-KIND mini saxophone ornament you'll always cherish. Celebrate Life’s Biggest Moments – Every year, you decorate your tree with decorations that represent the activities and special moments that bring you joy and fulfillment in life. With our Christmas tree music instrument ornaments 2022, expand your collection with the unique ornaments that represent your family’s greatest pleasures and accomplishments. Crafted with festive and vibrant colors, your music ornaments for Christmas tree will make your tree feel truly special and unique. 24 Hour order processing – these music Christmas ornaments make thoughtful saxophone player gifts for women, saxophonist gift, music teacher ornament gift, saxophone lover gift to cherish every season. Your saxophone ornaments for Christmas tree will arrive ready for gifting, nestled in tissue paper with a gift box, gift bag and gift tag – no need for wrapping! this holiday season, give the gift of joy with these musical ornaments for Christmas tree! Happy and Satisfied Music Lovers - at Holiday Traditions, we’re dedicated to crafting unique music tree decorations for families to celebrate the holidays – and their love for each other. Having been in business for over 17 years, creating and personalizing over 640,000 custom tree ornaments along the way, we’re experts in quality craftsmanship.If for any reason you don’t love your personalized music ornament, please reach out to us directly so we can make it right.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JDSlVF1DL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Holiday Traditions","source_asin":"B07JNDRJBJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-732913","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07JNDRJBJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07JNDRJBJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
