window.products.push({"id":732972,"name":"Aouton Sponge Holder for Kitchen Sink, Expandable (16.7\"-21.3\") Sink Caddy Sink Organizers, 4-in-1 Dish Sponges Brush Soap Holder with Dish Towels Dry","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81UTumi9TaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅2022 Upgrade Ideal Size - The width is 4.1”, height is 9.3”, the length can be adjusted from 16.7” to 21.3”, telescopic sink storage rack design makes it fit variable sink size. It’s most suitable for 14\"-20\" sink. You can measure your sink size before purchase it. ✅Premium Material - The expandable kitchen sponge holder is made of high-quality stainless steel material, rustproof and durable. The handles wrapped in silicone on both sides can effectively prevent sliding. ✅Multifunctional Kitchen Sink Accessories - 4-in-1 over the sink organizers, easily store your dish sponge, dish brush, dish soap, cleaning rag, sink plug, etc. Dry quickly inside sink without leaving outside messes, save your countertop space. ✅Ventilated Drain - The drain holes are evenly distributed, not to collect water. Open design, good ventilation, sponges and scrubbers air dry quickly, keep your sink dry and tidy. ✅100% Satisfaction Guarantee - If for any reason, our sink caddy doesn’t meet your needs all you need to do is let us know. From refund to replacement we’ll make it right for you. Don't wait any longer and enjoy it now.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81UTumi9TaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aouton","source_asin":"B0B11T75CZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-732972","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B11T75CZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B11T75CZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":732973,"name":"MECORDS Mini Garlic Chopper Electric Food Chopper 250ml Vegetable Chopper Gifts for Mom Portable Rechargeable Garlic Blender Small Mincer for Garlic O","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Wx2NeGYDS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are you still suffered from the need to connect a long cord when using the chopper? Are you still suffered from the complex buttons of the traditional chopper? Are you still suffered from the small amount of food that can not be chopped? Are you still suffered that chopper can not be used because of the water entering? Our product: -Wireless and USB Rechargeable -One-Button Operation -A Small Amount of Food Can Be Chopped -Waterproof -BPA Free - Sharp SUS 304 Stainless Steel Blade -Safety -250ML Capacity Specification: Dimension: 9.0cm x 9.0cm x 13.0cm 3.5 x 3.5 x 5.1inches Item Weight: 250g Color: White Rated power: 30W Rated voltage: 5V Rated frequency: 50Hz How to Use: 1.Place the blade Place the blades first before fill the ingredient in the container. The capacity of the food chopper is 250 ml.You can refer to the max line when filling the ingredient, and do not overload. 2.Cover the lid It is necessary to cover the lid in the right way. the chopper will not work if the cover is not on the right place. 3.Press power switch Press the power switch on the top of the chopper, and hold it for a few seconds, you will get an evenly shred food. It will automatically stop working after 30 seconds. If the food is not so delicate as you expected, You can continue to press the power switch for grinding. 4.Get a great shred food Open the chopper and remove the blades, you will get an evenly shred food. You can directly wash the chopper with water after use. Package list: 1 x USB Charging Cable 1x Stainless Steel Blade Kit 1 x Blender Cup 1 x Motor head 1 x Instruction","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Wx2NeGYDS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MECORDS","source_asin":"B0928K52X3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-732973","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0928K52X3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0928K52X3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
