window.products.push({"id":732981,"name":"ASPMIZ Microfiber Pineapple Beach Towel, Sand Free Fruit Beach Towels Oversized, Quick Dry Soft Large Bath Towels for Bathroom, Pool, Outdoor Camping ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/815ACxBfQuS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Designer Says: Whether it’s relaxing at the beach or lounging poolside, our sand free pineapple beach towel offer cozy comfort and optimal coverage. The summer beach towel ​oversize promote a feeling of fashion. And it make a great take-along choice for a getaway tropical vacation or summertime fun near the water. High-quality Materials: The tropical fruit beach towels adopt microfiber, the surface terry cloth is delicate, fast-drying and soft, breathable and water-absorbing, not easy to pilling and deforming, it's a must-have after your bath or shower! Sand Free: The Hawaiian pineapple bath towels for adult are very soft and smooth, so the sand would slide off, you leave the beach without the sands, leaving more sand at the beach for castles. Size Information: Our pineapple beach towels oversized size is 31.50”W x 59.10”H. The absorbent lightweight towels blanket size of this beach towel is suitable for most travel needs. Use Occasion: This large towel very suitable for beach, travel, swimming, pool, outdoor and sports. It’s also great for gym fitness, yoga, backpacking, or use as a beach blanket, picnic mat or bath towel. Gift Idea: The color of beach towel is refreshing-colored, quality of a material is soft, smooth and comfortable. It's your superior choice for outdoor travel, camping, practicing yoga, surfing or dipping. It’s truly an exceptional beach and travel towel and perfect gift idea for you and family. Package Includes: 1 x pineapple beach towel The quick dry towel is a perfect microfiber beach towel. We always provide the latest design! The new style of these designs is stylish, innovative and special, and the printed beach towel adds a sense of relaxation and fun. And make you and your family a fashionista.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/815ACxBfQuS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ASPMIZ","source_asin":"B08XZKZD2Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-732981","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XZKZD2Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XZKZD2Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":732982,"name":"Instant Read Thermometer, Digital Food Thermometer with Collapsible Internal Probe for Grill Barbecue Cooking Meat Kitchen Candy (Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vzCBqk5sL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Do you often fail to achieve the intended outcome of a recipe just because you couldn’t ensure accurate temperatures? Or Does your food often get undercooked or overcooked and embarrass you in front of many guests? Well, not anymore! AirChichi Brings to you an instant read thermometer that offers a perfect solution to all your problems and you will love it for its many incredible benefits:   Instant temperature readings - eliminates the need to wait for minutes to get the reading stable  High accuracy to help you precisely follow the recipe temperatures  Superior Quality Stainless Steel Probe - Sturdy and food-safe  Sharp end of probe helps penetrate even toughest meats easily  Probe length long enough to take food core temperatures easily - 4.4” long probe  Foldable design which ensures portability and compact storage  Handle made up of food grade ABS plastic  High resolution display LED display  Wide range of temperature measurements Prdouct Specifications Measuring range: -50℃ to 300℃ (From -58℉ To 572℉)  Display resolution: ± 0.1  Measuring Accuracy : ± 1 degree at temperature from -20℃ to 200℃ (-4℉ to 392℉)  Measuring Accuracy : ±2 degree for any other temperature range \"Hold\" Function  AUTO OFF - Switches off automatically when the probe is folded Notice: 1. Do not leave thermometer in oven while cooking, do not touch hot probe with bare hands.  2. Before withdrawing from food, press HOLD button. It will \"hold\" the temperature reading.  3. Wash the metal probe in soapy water. Clean thermometer by hand. Do not completely immerse in water.  4. The folding probe is with a sharp tapered end, fold away when not in use making the wireless unit a small and convenient size for your pocket or drawer","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vzCBqk5sL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AirChichi","source_asin":"B01MSOJ46Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-732982","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MSOJ46Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MSOJ46Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
